1
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:39,860
[Abyss]

2
00:01:40,830 --> 00:01:45,910
[2001]

3
00:01:46,650 --> 00:01:48,180
[Huangshui Technical School]

4
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:59,090
Hello, I'm calling to report an accident.

5
00:03:00,130 --> 00:03:02,530
I accidentally hit someone while driving.

6
00:03:12,170 --> 00:03:17,150
[Episode 8]

7
00:03:17,250 --> 00:03:18,410
The 15th?

8
00:03:19,210 --> 00:03:21,060
The 15th of this month...

9
00:03:22,300 --> 00:03:23,980
How can I remember something
from that long ago?

10
00:03:23,980 --> 00:03:25,880
It only rained
on those few days this month.

11
00:03:25,880 --> 00:03:26,770
It was a rainy day?

12
00:03:26,770 --> 00:03:27,820
Now that you mention it,

13
00:03:27,820 --> 00:03:29,540
it does ring a bell.

14
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:32,160
I wasn't planning to go out that day,

15
00:03:32,180 --> 00:03:34,790
but then I realized we were out of rice,

16
00:03:34,810 --> 00:03:36,190
so I went to buy some.

17
00:03:36,250 --> 00:03:38,950
I actually ran into Han on my way back.

18
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,690
This clock is malfunctioning?

19
00:03:49,690 --> 00:03:52,350
It's mechanical
and hasn't been wound for ages.

20
00:03:57,690 --> 00:03:59,750
This calendar is from over 10 years ago.

21
00:03:59,750 --> 00:04:01,080
Why do you still keep it?

22
00:04:01,630 --> 00:04:02,780
I just never got around to changing it.

23
00:04:02,780 --> 00:04:04,090
I rarely come back here

24
00:04:04,090 --> 00:04:05,750
after my parents passed away.

25
00:04:25,150 --> 00:04:27,610
What illness did your father die from?

26
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:28,750
Liver cancer.

27
00:04:29,490 --> 00:04:31,370
You said you rarely come back,

28
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:33,830
but the room's kept pretty clean.

29
00:04:34,510 --> 00:04:35,570
An unoccupied house

30
00:04:35,570 --> 00:04:37,940
stays nice
with just an occasional cleaning.

31
00:04:37,940 --> 00:04:38,750
Humans are

32
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:41,630
actually the dirtiest in this world.

33
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:47,330
The customers at your internet cafe
all say you are

34
00:04:47,330 --> 00:04:50,390
a generous, straightforward,
and reasonable guy.

35
00:04:51,390 --> 00:04:54,140
How could you have
such an extreme way of thinking?

36
00:04:54,140 --> 00:04:56,190
Which one is the real you?

37
00:04:59,170 --> 00:05:00,370
They are both real me.

38
00:05:06,620 --> 00:05:08,620
Don't you feel it's contradictory?

39
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:12,440
Humans are a mass of contradictions
in and of themselves.

40
00:05:12,940 --> 00:05:15,030
Is it illegal for me to think this way?

41
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:26,690
SN!

42
00:05:31,440 --> 00:05:32,540
Bro!

43
00:05:33,370 --> 00:05:35,430
What made you think of
treating me to a meal?

44
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:36,950
I want to verify something with you.

45
00:05:36,950 --> 00:05:38,590
I hope I'm not holding up your work.

46
00:05:38,590 --> 00:05:39,409
No, not at all.

47
00:05:40,060 --> 00:05:40,830
I quit my job.

48
00:05:42,190 --> 00:05:43,100
You quit?

49
00:05:44,010 --> 00:05:44,980
When?

50
00:05:44,980 --> 00:05:45,920
Just today,

51
00:05:45,980 --> 00:05:47,750
right at this moment.

52
00:05:48,540 --> 00:05:49,810
Does Zhang Chengguo know this?

53
00:05:49,810 --> 00:05:51,120
I didn't tell anyone.

54
00:05:51,150 --> 00:05:53,050
I just grabbed my things
and left right away.

55
00:05:53,050 --> 00:05:54,930
I unilaterally got rid of them.

56
00:05:55,760 --> 00:05:56,690
Wait.

57
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,220
You were doing just fine.

58
00:05:58,220 --> 00:05:59,950
Why did you quit all of a sudden?

59
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:04,110
I've always wanted
to run an internet cafe, right?

60
00:06:04,610 --> 00:06:07,070
There's finally someone willing to invest.

61
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:09,100
What's that saying again?

62
00:06:09,620 --> 00:06:12,590
"A true dragon isn't meant for a pond."

63
00:06:12,950 --> 00:06:15,970
I, Sun Qiang, won't be stuck
in a mud pond for life.

64
00:06:17,080 --> 00:06:18,210
Who's the investor?

65
00:06:18,370 --> 00:06:19,690
This is a trade secret.

66
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:21,270
Trade secret, you know?

67
00:06:21,890 --> 00:06:23,760
Make sure to come
and support me when it opens.

68
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:24,920
Waiter!

69
00:06:25,540 --> 00:06:27,310
We want to order!
We've been sitting here for ages!

70
00:06:27,310 --> 00:06:29,110
Why didn't you bring us the menu?

71
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:42,420
Tell me

72
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:45,159
about your discoveries.

73
00:06:45,490 --> 00:06:46,520
He did it.

74
00:06:46,740 --> 00:06:47,820
Hu Xiaofei,

75
00:06:47,850 --> 00:06:49,140
Song Laifu,

76
00:06:49,409 --> 00:06:50,520
and Bi Dehua—

77
00:06:50,540 --> 00:06:52,680
he killed at least one of them.

78
00:06:53,050 --> 00:06:55,380
He definitely knows what happened.

79
00:06:56,140 --> 00:06:59,070
His good friend died, and he didn't even
want to ask more about it.

80
00:06:59,070 --> 00:07:00,950
He didn't even bother hiding his emotions.

81
00:07:00,950 --> 00:07:03,460
He didn't take us seriously at all.

82
00:07:03,500 --> 00:07:06,440
Strategically, he looked down on us.

83
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:07,940
But tactically,

84
00:07:08,010 --> 00:07:10,480
he didn't let his guard down at all.

85
00:07:10,540 --> 00:07:12,130
Bi Dehua died too long ago,

86
00:07:12,130 --> 00:07:13,530
so let's not mention him.

87
00:07:13,620 --> 00:07:16,450
Not even a single hair
of Han Pinmu was found

88
00:07:16,450 --> 00:07:19,140
at the scenes
where Hu Xiaofei and Song Laifu died.

89
00:07:19,140 --> 00:07:22,330
There are no clues
at his home or the internet cafe.

90
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,160
I guess

91
00:07:23,180 --> 00:07:24,650
the half photo you mentioned

92
00:07:24,650 --> 00:07:26,330
has also been disposed of.

93
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:28,890
That makes his motive
for the murder pretty unclear.

94
00:07:28,890 --> 00:07:30,070
Unless you can establish

95
00:07:30,070 --> 00:07:32,270
a link between Han Pinmu
and the 3/12 Case,

96
00:07:32,270 --> 00:07:32,930
you can't

97
00:07:32,930 --> 00:07:35,870
even prove that he knows Mr. San.

98
00:07:53,570 --> 00:07:55,970
Should we take him back for interrogation?

99
00:07:56,270 --> 00:07:57,870
You are the captain. It's your call.

100
00:07:57,870 --> 00:07:59,170
Save it!

101
00:07:59,430 --> 00:08:00,510
If you really respect me this much,

102
00:08:00,510 --> 00:08:02,550
why would you call me "Fan the Speedster"?

103
00:08:02,550 --> 00:08:04,550
Tell me, what do you think?

104
00:08:09,900 --> 00:08:12,770
I did see someone
come to pick a fight with Song.

105
00:08:13,610 --> 00:08:15,610
But it wasn't Chen Chunli's nephew.

106
00:08:15,620 --> 00:08:17,240
It was someone we both know.

107
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,540
Han Pinmu?

108
00:08:24,370 --> 00:08:26,830
Why did Han Pinmu have a fight with Song?

109
00:08:26,850 --> 00:08:27,800
I don't know.

110
00:08:28,510 --> 00:08:29,910
I only caught a few words.

111
00:08:30,500 --> 00:08:33,080
Han yelled that even if he had to die,

112
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:35,210
he would drag Song Laifu down with him.

113
00:08:35,419 --> 00:08:37,179
That was no small argument.

114
00:08:38,159 --> 00:08:39,390
Then why did Zhang Chengguo say

115
00:08:39,390 --> 00:08:40,640
it was Chen Chunli's nephew?

116
00:08:40,640 --> 00:08:42,169
I just made it up to fool him.

117
00:08:42,890 --> 00:08:44,270
I didn't want to explain to him

118
00:08:44,270 --> 00:08:45,940
my relationship with Han.

119
00:08:46,790 --> 00:08:47,550
However,

120
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,450
I did see Han Pinmu

121
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:51,090
come to the hotel looking for Chen Chunli.

122
00:08:51,090 --> 00:08:53,020
The two of them seemed quite close.

123
00:08:54,700 --> 00:08:57,370
Han Pinmu and Chen Chunli are close?

124
00:09:01,590 --> 00:09:03,250
Do you know Chen Chunli's son?

125
00:09:03,260 --> 00:09:03,930
Nope.

126
00:09:05,810 --> 00:09:07,170
Did you see anyone else

127
00:09:07,170 --> 00:09:08,910
come to see Chen Chunli at the hotel

128
00:09:08,910 --> 00:09:10,870
who is about Han Pinmu's age?

129
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:13,370
Besides Han Pinmu,

130
00:09:13,410 --> 00:09:15,270
there was only that drunk old man.

131
00:09:15,750 --> 00:09:16,730
He doesn't count, does he?

132
00:09:16,730 --> 00:09:17,470
No.

133
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:20,390
Then why didn't you
tell the police when they

134
00:09:20,390 --> 00:09:21,750
made inquiries at the hotel?

135
00:09:21,750 --> 00:09:24,080
I'm just a security guard.

136
00:09:24,150 --> 00:09:26,480
The less trouble, the better.

137
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,440
Besides, Han

138
00:09:29,010 --> 00:09:30,240
is my acquaintance.

139
00:09:30,470 --> 00:09:32,330
So I couldn't stab him in the back.

140
00:09:32,550 --> 00:09:34,040
And now you can?

141
00:09:34,070 --> 00:09:35,670
He betrayed me first.

142
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:37,130
Cheng,

143
00:09:37,190 --> 00:09:38,940
not until recently did I find out

144
00:09:38,940 --> 00:09:40,670
that he's been badmouthing me a lot.

145
00:09:40,670 --> 00:09:41,440
Why?

146
00:09:41,710 --> 00:09:44,800
There are over 100,000 people
in our county.

147
00:09:44,820 --> 00:09:48,150
How much business
could my internet cafe take away from him?

148
00:09:50,830 --> 00:09:53,280
Can you take responsibility
for what you said?

149
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:54,690
Take responsibility? How?

150
00:09:54,690 --> 00:09:56,320
Go to the public security bureau
and make a statement.

151
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,390
Why not?

152
00:09:57,390 --> 00:09:58,120
Let's go

153
00:09:58,480 --> 00:09:59,810
after we finish eating.

154
00:09:59,810 --> 00:10:00,450
Okay.

155
00:10:12,070 --> 00:10:15,270
You're not allowed
to leave Huangshui County for a month.

156
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,890
For emergencies like attending funerals

157
00:10:16,890 --> 00:10:18,120
or having medical treatments

158
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:19,650
that require you to leave the county,

159
00:10:19,650 --> 00:10:22,030
you must get approval
from our public security bureau.

160
00:10:22,030 --> 00:10:24,120
If there's anything else
you need to inquire about,

161
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:26,000
I can go back with you right now.

162
00:10:26,970 --> 00:10:27,680
No rush.

163
00:10:28,470 --> 00:10:29,790
There will definitely be a chance.

164
00:10:29,790 --> 00:10:31,120
Don't worry about that.

165
00:10:31,900 --> 00:10:33,560
Just wait in the internet cafe

166
00:10:33,820 --> 00:10:35,220
and play a few more games,

167
00:10:35,420 --> 00:10:37,370
in case you can't play anymore.

168
00:10:37,820 --> 00:10:38,950
That would be a pity.

169
00:10:39,930 --> 00:10:40,550
Right?

170
00:10:49,810 --> 00:10:50,470
Hello.

171
00:10:58,640 --> 00:10:59,330
Got it.

172
00:11:02,850 --> 00:11:03,990
[Police]

173
00:11:02,900 --> 00:11:03,560
See?

174
00:11:04,250 --> 00:11:06,110
Plans can't keep up with changes.

175
00:11:06,740 --> 00:11:10,140
You really have to come
to the bureau with me for a proper talk.

176
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:22,060
You know
why we brought you back here, right?

177
00:11:22,130 --> 00:11:22,930
I don't know.

178
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:25,160
Alright then.

179
00:11:26,890 --> 00:11:29,000
Take a look. Do you know this person?

180
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:30,900
Nope.

181
00:11:30,930 --> 00:11:32,180
Is he a customer at my internet cafe?

182
00:11:32,180 --> 00:11:33,400
Stop playing dumb.

183
00:11:33,530 --> 00:11:34,980
You two have known each other
for a long time,

184
00:11:34,980 --> 00:11:37,300
and you have a deep-rooted conflict.

185
00:11:37,430 --> 00:11:38,950
I don't even know his name.

186
00:11:38,980 --> 00:11:41,910
He's the parking lot attendant
at Huangzhiyuan Hotel.

187
00:11:41,910 --> 00:11:43,510
He calls himself Song Laifu.

188
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:45,380
Some people also call him Mr. San.

189
00:11:45,950 --> 00:11:48,100
So he's that Song Laifu
you were talking about.

190
00:11:48,100 --> 00:11:48,980
Han Pinmu,

191
00:11:49,460 --> 00:11:50,480
stop pretending.

192
00:11:51,080 --> 00:11:53,390
Someone saw you two arguing,

193
00:11:53,570 --> 00:11:55,740
and you even threatened to kill him.

194
00:11:55,770 --> 00:11:57,100
How do you explain that?

195
00:11:57,220 --> 00:11:58,530
It's pretty easy to explain.

196
00:11:58,530 --> 00:12:01,270
For example, I went to have a meal
at Huangzhiyuan Hotel,

197
00:12:01,270 --> 00:12:03,290
and he was
the parking lot attendant there.

198
00:12:03,290 --> 00:12:05,300
We got into an argument

199
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,520
over the parking fee,

200
00:12:06,610 --> 00:12:08,150
but I don't quite remember now.

201
00:12:08,150 --> 00:12:09,670
You threatened to kill him

202
00:12:09,670 --> 00:12:11,330
just because of a parking fee?

203
00:12:11,460 --> 00:12:13,190
Do you think we'd believe that?

204
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:14,750
I was young and cocky,

205
00:12:14,750 --> 00:12:16,510
bragging without watching my mouth.

206
00:12:16,510 --> 00:12:17,440
Is that illegal?

207
00:12:18,660 --> 00:12:19,430
Han Pinmu,

208
00:12:19,860 --> 00:12:21,540
don't think you're really smart.

209
00:12:21,540 --> 00:12:23,280
We know your situation very well.

210
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:24,840
-Letting you...
-Letting me come clean

211
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:25,670
is to give me a chance

212
00:12:25,670 --> 00:12:27,370
for a lighter sentence
by helping with the case.

213
00:12:27,370 --> 00:12:28,230
I understand.

214
00:12:28,730 --> 00:12:29,790
Officers,

215
00:12:29,820 --> 00:12:30,870
these tricks

216
00:12:30,870 --> 00:12:32,880
might work on someone
who's got something to hide.

217
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:34,290
But I've got nothing to feel guilty about.

218
00:12:34,290 --> 00:12:35,500
You can't scare me.

219
00:12:35,630 --> 00:12:37,080
Why have you never been curious

220
00:12:37,080 --> 00:12:39,010
about what happened to Song Laifu?

221
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:42,210
It has nothing to do with me.

222
00:12:42,210 --> 00:12:43,640
When I was little, my dad just taught me

223
00:12:43,640 --> 00:12:45,670
that unnecessary curiosity
can get you killed.

224
00:12:45,670 --> 00:12:47,140
Even though he's a jerk,

225
00:12:47,170 --> 00:12:48,530
he was right about that.

226
00:12:49,720 --> 00:12:50,910
Since you brought up your dad,

227
00:12:50,910 --> 00:12:52,100
let's talk about him for a bit.

228
00:12:52,100 --> 00:12:53,870
In 2001, your biological mother
had a car accident.

229
00:12:53,870 --> 00:12:55,120
Two months later,

230
00:12:55,140 --> 00:12:59,000
your dad married your stepmother, Du Juan.

231
00:13:00,250 --> 00:13:02,220
Pretty efficient, huh?

232
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:05,530
Could it be that

233
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:08,300
your dad had been cheating all along?

234
00:13:08,410 --> 00:13:10,440
I just came up with another explanation.

235
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:11,700
Maybe

236
00:13:11,700 --> 00:13:13,340
the person who said
I argued with Song Laifu

237
00:13:13,340 --> 00:13:14,100
was lying.

238
00:13:14,100 --> 00:13:16,340
Is he a security guard
at Huangzhiyuan Hotel?

239
00:13:16,340 --> 00:13:19,140
I just remembered someone
I have a grudge against.

240
00:13:21,750 --> 00:13:24,010
I don't want to talk about that right now.

241
00:13:24,110 --> 00:13:26,590
I just want to talk about your parents.

242
00:13:27,130 --> 00:13:28,820
What do my parents have to do
with Song Laifu?

243
00:13:28,820 --> 00:13:30,710
Your dad had an affair with Du Juan,

244
00:13:30,710 --> 00:13:33,140
and your mom happened to die
in a car accident.

245
00:13:33,140 --> 00:13:35,880
So your dad married his mistress.

246
00:13:35,900 --> 00:13:38,160
You couldn't accept it,

247
00:13:38,660 --> 00:13:41,590
so your conflict with Du Juan deepened.

248
00:13:43,530 --> 00:13:45,010
Let me make this clear to you.

249
00:13:45,010 --> 00:13:46,170
It wasn't a coincidence.

250
00:13:46,170 --> 00:13:47,460
The drunk driver who killed my mom

251
00:13:47,460 --> 00:13:48,790
was hired by Du Juan.

252
00:13:48,810 --> 00:13:50,080
Du Juan got my mom killed.

253
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:51,580
She was the real murderer.

254
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:54,450
I went to the public security bureau
and the traffic police office,

255
00:13:54,450 --> 00:13:55,930
but no one believed me.

256
00:13:56,860 --> 00:13:58,980
You useless cops

257
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:01,640
deserve to die just like Du Juan.

258
00:14:01,640 --> 00:14:02,880
The police investigated it.

259
00:14:02,880 --> 00:14:04,930
There was no evidence to prove

260
00:14:04,950 --> 00:14:06,450
the contract killing you mentioned.

261
00:14:06,450 --> 00:14:08,150
That was
just because you were incompetent.

262
00:14:08,150 --> 00:14:09,670
So you had Hu Xiaofei

263
00:14:09,670 --> 00:14:11,580
find the desperado, Mr. San,

264
00:14:11,960 --> 00:14:13,770
and asked him to kill Du Juan.

265
00:14:19,520 --> 00:14:20,420
No, I didn't.

266
00:14:21,900 --> 00:14:23,160
That was a real coincidence.

267
00:14:23,160 --> 00:14:26,560
No, it was karma

268
00:14:27,280 --> 00:14:28,310
getting her.

269
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:38,910
How do you know Chen Chunli?

270
00:14:39,020 --> 00:14:39,780
Who?

271
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:42,850
Chen Chunli.

272
00:14:43,300 --> 00:14:45,560
You once went to the hotel
to look for her.

273
00:14:45,820 --> 00:14:48,880
My dad investigated the 3/12 Case
for Du Juan back then.

274
00:14:48,980 --> 00:14:50,360
He found out about Chen Chunli

275
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:51,980
through many channels.

276
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:53,980
I went to find her with my dad.

277
00:14:54,210 --> 00:14:55,900
To ask about some details of the case,

278
00:14:55,900 --> 00:14:57,490
my dad even paid Chen Chunli.

279
00:14:57,490 --> 00:14:58,990
You're lying.

280
00:14:59,340 --> 00:15:01,150
Since you hate Du Juan so much,

281
00:15:01,170 --> 00:15:04,330
how could you possibly
go track down the suspect with your dad?

282
00:15:04,330 --> 00:15:06,890
You can ask Chen Chunli
if you don't believe me.

283
00:15:06,890 --> 00:15:07,750
I wanted to talk about this,

284
00:15:07,750 --> 00:15:09,850
but you just interrupted me abruptly.

285
00:15:09,850 --> 00:15:12,500
Who can prove
that I argued with Song Laifu?

286
00:15:12,730 --> 00:15:13,610
Sun Qiang?

287
00:15:13,910 --> 00:15:16,100
We can't answer this question for now.

288
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:17,420
It must be him.

289
00:15:18,500 --> 00:15:21,160
I know he works as a security guard
at that hotel.

290
00:15:21,460 --> 00:15:22,420
You know what?

291
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:24,530
Sun Qiang also wants to open
an internet cafe.

292
00:15:24,530 --> 00:15:26,900
He's always seen me as his competitor

293
00:15:26,920 --> 00:15:29,850
and had delusions
that I would stop or persecute him.

294
00:15:29,890 --> 00:15:31,170
But I actually couldn't care less

295
00:15:31,170 --> 00:15:32,570
about what he wants to do.

296
00:15:32,880 --> 00:15:34,840
He was very likely lying to frame me.

297
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:36,440
Could you ask him to provide

298
00:15:36,500 --> 00:15:38,770
the video of me arguing with Song Laifu?

299
00:15:39,630 --> 00:15:40,510
Does he have it?

300
00:15:40,690 --> 00:15:43,170
You can't just
take his word for it, right?

301
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:44,200
Even if...

302
00:15:44,470 --> 00:15:46,520
Even if I did argue with Song Laifu,

303
00:15:46,540 --> 00:15:47,220
so what?

304
00:15:47,220 --> 00:15:48,390
What does that prove?

305
00:15:48,390 --> 00:15:50,700
The law is about
the presumption of innocence.

306
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:52,720
You need evidence to prove what I did,

307
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:55,000
and I don't need to prove
what I didn't do.

308
00:15:56,190 --> 00:16:00,170
[Public Security]

309
00:16:07,770 --> 00:16:09,770
This man is well prepared.

310
00:16:10,130 --> 00:16:10,940
He must have

311
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:13,100
anticipated all sorts of situations.

312
00:16:16,660 --> 00:16:19,280
He had an extraordinarily strong reaction
when we

313
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:21,130
talked about his parents just now.

314
00:16:21,130 --> 00:16:23,880
If Du Juan really hired someone
to murder his mother,

315
00:16:23,880 --> 00:16:25,790
then his motive for the crime back then

316
00:16:25,790 --> 00:16:26,910
makes perfect sense.

317
00:16:26,910 --> 00:16:28,120
You're stating the obvious.

318
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:29,440
As long as he thinks so,

319
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:30,650
the motive just makes sense.

320
00:16:30,650 --> 00:16:32,980
But what's the use
if you have no evidence?

321
00:16:33,180 --> 00:16:34,950
The fact that he dared to say it himself

322
00:16:34,950 --> 00:16:37,150
means he's sure we don't have evidence.

323
00:16:38,030 --> 00:16:39,140
A confession alone

324
00:16:39,280 --> 00:16:41,470
is not enough to close this case.

325
00:16:41,880 --> 00:16:44,130
The point is that
we don't even have a confession now.

326
00:16:44,130 --> 00:16:50,390
[Huangshui Public Security]

327
00:17:01,980 --> 00:17:04,420
Li Cheng once saw that half of the photo.

328
00:17:04,930 --> 00:17:06,180
But he didn't find it.

329
00:17:06,270 --> 00:17:07,829
I know he didn't find it.

330
00:17:08,270 --> 00:17:09,069
I mean,

331
00:17:09,069 --> 00:17:10,569
can you make a breakthrough

332
00:17:10,569 --> 00:17:11,720
from this angle?

333
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:14,920
He's got
strong psychological defenses, huh?

334
00:17:14,920 --> 00:17:17,359
Push him again from this angle,

335
00:17:17,470 --> 00:17:18,380
just like you did

336
00:17:18,380 --> 00:17:20,440
when you found the angle with his parents.

337
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:21,400
And his relationship

338
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:23,609
with Hu Xiaofei and Bi Dehua is definitely

339
00:17:23,609 --> 00:17:25,550
not as simple as he claimed.

340
00:17:25,550 --> 00:17:27,050
No, no way.

341
00:17:27,079 --> 00:17:29,690
Only a few people can enter his room.

342
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:31,830
If the photo you mentioned doesn't work,

343
00:17:31,830 --> 00:17:32,810
Li Cheng

344
00:17:32,810 --> 00:17:34,310
might be exposed.

345
00:17:34,310 --> 00:17:35,960
Now you're getting anxious?

346
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:37,160
Where were you before?

347
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:38,450
You could just write a report openly

348
00:17:38,450 --> 00:17:39,550
and let Hu Sen and Wang Tao go!

349
00:17:39,550 --> 00:17:40,330
That's it!

350
00:17:40,330 --> 00:17:41,590
Now you're worrying for nothing.

351
00:17:41,590 --> 00:17:42,980
You know nothing.

352
00:17:41,690 --> 00:17:44,190
[Huangshui Public Security]

353
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:44,790
The county is not so big.

354
00:17:45,180 --> 00:17:47,240
And the internet cafe's got
all kinds of people coming and going.

355
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:48,270
It's inevitable that someone

356
00:17:48,270 --> 00:17:49,990
would know
that Hu and the others are cops.

357
00:17:49,990 --> 00:17:51,860
We have to use newbies, new faces,

358
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:52,960
you know?

359
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:53,720
Besides,

360
00:17:53,740 --> 00:17:55,140
are they anywhere near Li Cheng's level

361
00:17:55,140 --> 00:17:56,030
in gaming?

362
00:17:56,030 --> 00:17:57,220
They couldn't even play together!

363
00:17:57,220 --> 00:17:58,380
Fine, fine. You know everything.

364
00:17:58,380 --> 00:17:59,240
You know it all.

365
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:01,010
Since you know it all,
get him to confess in 24 hours.

366
00:18:01,010 --> 00:18:02,580
Stop acting like a great detective.

367
00:18:02,580 --> 00:18:03,350
Without a confession,

368
00:18:03,350 --> 00:18:05,410
we'll have no choice but to let him go.

369
00:18:08,550 --> 00:18:09,110
Come on.

370
00:18:09,140 --> 00:18:10,090
Hurry, here, right here.

371
00:18:10,090 --> 00:18:11,150
Rub this, rub this.

372
00:18:25,540 --> 00:18:27,290
Captain Fan, Master.

373
00:18:28,450 --> 00:18:29,210
Li Cheng.

374
00:18:30,570 --> 00:18:33,100
You know Han Pinmu
and Sun Qiang better than we do.

375
00:18:33,100 --> 00:18:35,760
Do you think
Sun Qiang's testimony is credible?

376
00:18:36,330 --> 00:18:37,460
I think it is credible.

377
00:18:37,460 --> 00:18:38,720
But on our way here,

378
00:18:38,750 --> 00:18:40,110
he said he was the only one

379
00:18:40,110 --> 00:18:41,400
who saw Han Pinmu

380
00:18:41,430 --> 00:18:43,090
and Song Laifu having a fight.

381
00:18:43,370 --> 00:18:45,110
Zhang Chengguo also heard it from him.

382
00:18:45,110 --> 00:18:47,240
There is no one else to corroborate it.

383
00:18:48,420 --> 00:18:50,290
Han Pinmu claimed that
Sun Qiang has a conflict with him.

384
00:18:50,290 --> 00:18:51,240
Is that true?

385
00:18:53,030 --> 00:18:53,680
Yep.

386
00:18:54,250 --> 00:18:55,380
[Night of Champions]

387
00:18:57,690 --> 00:18:58,510
[Get a pentakill
and earn ¥20 in free play time!]

388
00:19:01,320 --> 00:19:03,240
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

389
00:19:07,740 --> 00:19:12,290
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

390
00:19:12,510 --> 00:19:14,400
Can I participate in the interrogation?

391
00:19:14,400 --> 00:19:15,000
No way.

392
00:19:15,380 --> 00:19:16,860
What's the point of your participation?

393
00:19:16,860 --> 00:19:17,940
I always feel that

394
00:19:17,970 --> 00:19:19,240
Han Pinmu let me see

395
00:19:19,270 --> 00:19:20,530
that photo on purpose.

396
00:19:20,560 --> 00:19:21,270
For what purpose?

397
00:19:21,270 --> 00:19:22,680
The other half of the photo

398
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:24,400
was found at Hu Xiaofei's death scene.

399
00:19:24,400 --> 00:19:26,440
If such a coincidence
was intentionally designed,

400
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:28,790
wouldn't he be
bringing trouble on himself?

401
00:19:28,790 --> 00:19:31,350
What if Han Pinmu intentionally
exposed himself

402
00:19:31,350 --> 00:19:32,790
to cover for the real murderer?

403
00:19:32,790 --> 00:19:33,900
Who is he covering for?

404
00:19:33,900 --> 00:19:35,100
His family is all dead.

405
00:19:35,100 --> 00:19:36,110
You guys at the internet cafe

406
00:19:36,110 --> 00:19:37,480
are his best friends.

407
00:19:37,480 --> 00:19:38,740
Who is he covering for?

408
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:40,240
Take a bold guess.

409
00:19:40,700 --> 00:19:42,720
Could it be Chen Chunli

410
00:19:42,980 --> 00:19:44,440
taking revenge after all these years?

411
00:19:44,440 --> 00:19:45,460
That's impossible.

412
00:19:45,460 --> 00:19:47,440
Zhao, if we guess like this,
we're going off track.

413
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:48,970
No way, this is impossible.

414
00:19:50,720 --> 00:19:52,180
You already know Song Laifu

415
00:19:52,180 --> 00:19:53,810
is a fake identity, right?

416
00:19:55,180 --> 00:19:56,610
Big Red Date told me.

417
00:19:57,250 --> 00:19:57,980
Zhao.

418
00:19:58,170 --> 00:20:00,850
The fake Song Laifu is nicknamed Mr. San.

419
00:20:01,420 --> 00:20:02,440
We want to figure out

420
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:04,400
why he stayed in Huangshui.

421
00:20:04,430 --> 00:20:07,710
But we've run into a lot of resistance
in investigating Li Zhengbin.

422
00:20:07,710 --> 00:20:09,140
He's got a super busy business

423
00:20:09,140 --> 00:20:11,010
as well as complex social connections.

424
00:20:11,010 --> 00:20:13,180
We haven't
found anything suspicious for now.

425
00:20:13,180 --> 00:20:14,940
Zhao, I can't believe it.

426
00:20:14,940 --> 00:20:16,500
You literally tell him everything.

427
00:20:16,500 --> 00:20:17,980
At this point,

428
00:20:17,980 --> 00:20:19,880
you still don't see Li Cheng as one of us?

429
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:21,180
But since you're in this uniform,

430
00:20:21,180 --> 00:20:23,090
you can't be lax
about necessary procedures.

431
00:20:23,090 --> 00:20:25,960
If we can't get anything
on Han Pinmu this time,

432
00:20:25,960 --> 00:20:28,500
Li Cheng will have to keep
staying undercover by his side

433
00:20:28,500 --> 00:20:30,230
and monitoring his movements!

434
00:20:30,290 --> 00:20:31,400
We can't give him a chance

435
00:20:31,400 --> 00:20:33,590
to escape or commit another crime!

436
00:20:37,030 --> 00:20:38,180
Captain Fan,

437
00:20:38,480 --> 00:20:39,790
can you think of a way

438
00:20:39,810 --> 00:20:41,500
to turn Li Cheng's work

439
00:20:41,520 --> 00:20:43,480
into an official mission?

440
00:20:44,030 --> 00:20:45,460
As omnipotent as you are,

441
00:20:45,460 --> 00:20:46,790
you can pull it off with just a report.

442
00:20:46,790 --> 00:20:48,320
I can consider it.

443
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:50,660
But when he transfers
to the Criminal Investigation Brigade

444
00:20:50,660 --> 00:20:51,940
one day, he should follow me, not you.

445
00:20:51,940 --> 00:20:52,720
Deal?

446
00:20:53,240 --> 00:20:55,110
Deal! I mean, why not?

447
00:20:55,940 --> 00:20:56,610
Li Cheng.

448
00:20:57,490 --> 00:20:59,690
Come on, change the way you address him.

449
00:21:01,330 --> 00:21:03,530
Master Fan, I'll follow you from now on.

450
00:21:05,140 --> 00:21:06,640
Oh, look at this.

451
00:21:07,010 --> 00:21:08,440
Look at the shameless master

452
00:21:08,440 --> 00:21:10,160
and apprentice.

453
00:21:10,180 --> 00:21:12,380
The apprentice takes after his master.

454
00:21:14,200 --> 00:21:15,810
Captain Fan, Captain Zhao,

455
00:21:16,420 --> 00:21:19,220
something happened
at Han Pinmu's internet cafe.

456
00:21:21,450 --> 00:21:25,460
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

457
00:21:24,960 --> 00:21:26,610
Did you see the arsonist?

458
00:21:26,610 --> 00:21:28,900
No, the arsonist already ran away
when I came out.

459
00:21:28,900 --> 00:21:29,900
Where is your boss?

460
00:21:29,900 --> 00:21:31,230
He was taken away by you.

461
00:21:31,330 --> 00:21:33,190
Taken away by us? What do you mean?

462
00:21:33,950 --> 00:21:36,390
The police took him away.

463
00:21:37,290 --> 00:21:38,290
You were the first

464
00:21:38,290 --> 00:21:39,750
to notice the fire, right?

465
00:21:39,810 --> 00:21:40,720
I smelled smoke,

466
00:21:40,720 --> 00:21:41,660
so I ran out from inside.

467
00:21:41,660 --> 00:21:42,400
I saw the fire

468
00:21:42,400 --> 00:21:43,400
and hurried back to get the extinguisher.

469
00:21:43,400 --> 00:21:44,200
Wei,

470
00:21:44,270 --> 00:21:45,420
what happened?

471
00:21:45,830 --> 00:21:46,460
I don't know.

472
00:21:46,460 --> 00:21:48,990
Someone set a fire
and burned the storefront.

473
00:21:50,460 --> 00:21:51,420
It's you.

474
00:21:52,790 --> 00:21:53,350
Hello, officer.

475
00:21:53,350 --> 00:21:53,770
You...

476
00:21:53,770 --> 00:21:54,460
Zhang.

477
00:21:54,900 --> 00:21:56,160
Someone saw the arsonist

478
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:57,220
running that way.

479
00:21:57,220 --> 00:21:58,710
Let's check
the surveillance footage nearby.

480
00:21:58,710 --> 00:21:59,290
Got it.

481
00:22:02,600 --> 00:22:04,640
You know this policeman?

482
00:22:05,920 --> 00:22:07,250
Someone once made trouble

483
00:22:07,250 --> 00:22:08,220
at my mom's workplace,

484
00:22:08,220 --> 00:22:09,420
and he helped handle it.

485
00:22:09,420 --> 00:22:11,620
Didn't expect him to still remember me.

486
00:22:12,490 --> 00:22:13,720
Can you still open for business?

487
00:22:13,720 --> 00:22:15,720
We'll be closed for at least half a month.

488
00:22:15,720 --> 00:22:17,090
Good thing no customers were injured.

489
00:22:17,090 --> 00:22:18,810
Otherwise, we wouldn't even
pass the fire inspection

490
00:22:18,810 --> 00:22:19,810
and would surely be shut down.

491
00:22:19,810 --> 00:22:22,440
I think that's the arsonist's purpose—

492
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:24,070
to burn down our shop.

493
00:22:24,170 --> 00:22:26,430
I'm wondering when the Boss will be back.

494
00:22:26,650 --> 00:22:28,850
How am I supposed to explain this to him?

495
00:22:30,660 --> 00:22:32,390
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

496
00:22:38,390 --> 00:22:41,670
[Public Security]

497
00:22:45,270 --> 00:22:47,000
-Captain Zhao.
-Captain Zhao.

498
00:22:52,980 --> 00:22:54,180
You didn't take a nap?

499
00:22:54,240 --> 00:22:55,800
Why sleep so much in life,

500
00:22:55,830 --> 00:22:58,030
when you'll sleep forever after death?

501
00:23:07,590 --> 00:23:09,160
I sprained my back again.

502
00:23:10,890 --> 00:23:13,350
Then you're the one
who should get more rest.

503
00:23:15,140 --> 00:23:16,940
You actually care about people?

504
00:23:18,230 --> 00:23:19,800
I have some news for you.

505
00:23:20,660 --> 00:23:22,660
Your internet cafe was burned down.

506
00:23:23,380 --> 00:23:24,250
Who did it?

507
00:23:24,480 --> 00:23:26,080
We're still investigating.

508
00:23:27,750 --> 00:23:29,880
People always say "murder and arson."

509
00:23:29,960 --> 00:23:31,960
If arson is mentioned
in the same breath as murder,

510
00:23:31,960 --> 00:23:33,420
the charge must be quite serious, huh?

511
00:23:33,420 --> 00:23:34,110
See?

512
00:23:34,590 --> 00:23:36,250
He's not surprised at all.

513
00:23:39,360 --> 00:23:40,770
I'm running a business.

514
00:23:40,870 --> 00:23:43,380
It's inevitable to offend
some crazy, silly men

515
00:23:43,380 --> 00:23:45,380
who never think about the consequences.

516
00:23:45,380 --> 00:23:45,980
Fine.

517
00:23:46,610 --> 00:23:48,200
Then I'll tell you one more thing.

518
00:23:48,200 --> 00:23:50,810
Let's see
if we can surprise him this time.

519
00:23:53,830 --> 00:23:55,530
Your friend, Hu Xiaofei,

520
00:23:55,530 --> 00:23:58,120
is one of the suspects in the 3/12 Case.

521
00:23:58,640 --> 00:24:00,880
That means your stepmother, Du Juan,

522
00:24:00,880 --> 00:24:02,940
was very likely killed by Hu Xiaofei

523
00:24:02,940 --> 00:24:04,950
and Bi Dehua.

524
00:24:06,410 --> 00:24:08,970
Xiaofei was also involved?

525
00:24:09,660 --> 00:24:10,240
See?

526
00:24:10,700 --> 00:24:12,160
He's still not surprised.

527
00:24:15,090 --> 00:24:17,520
I had my suspicions after reading

528
00:24:17,540 --> 00:24:19,070
Xiaofei's novel, "Abyss."

529
00:24:19,750 --> 00:24:21,110
A lot of stuff in the novel

530
00:24:21,110 --> 00:24:23,180
matches what my dad painstakingly

531
00:24:23,200 --> 00:24:24,690
dug into back then.

532
00:24:24,810 --> 00:24:26,670
But I never told him those details.

533
00:24:26,670 --> 00:24:28,670
What details did you
and your dad find out?

534
00:24:28,670 --> 00:24:30,200
Just what you already know—

535
00:24:30,200 --> 00:24:32,030
the 3 possible suspects,

536
00:24:32,060 --> 00:24:34,790
the time and locations of the 5 cases,

537
00:24:34,830 --> 00:24:37,790
the victims' gender, age, identity,

538
00:24:37,790 --> 00:24:39,450
and some family backgrounds.

539
00:24:39,720 --> 00:24:41,740
The reports back then were pretty vague

540
00:24:41,740 --> 00:24:43,000
on these details,

541
00:24:43,000 --> 00:24:45,530
while Xiaofei wrote them
pretty accurately.

542
00:24:46,210 --> 00:24:48,930
Hu Xiaofei's novel wasn't finished.

543
00:24:49,080 --> 00:24:50,840
Did he ever tell you

544
00:24:51,180 --> 00:24:53,310
how the rest of the story would unfold?

545
00:24:53,520 --> 00:24:54,390
Nope.

546
00:24:54,420 --> 00:24:56,320
The novel didn't get many views,

547
00:24:56,500 --> 00:24:58,300
so he wrote more and more slowly.

548
00:24:59,570 --> 00:25:02,260
Did Hu Xiaofei write the novel

549
00:25:04,780 --> 00:25:06,460
really just to make money?

550
00:25:06,490 --> 00:25:07,440
What else could it be?

551
00:25:07,440 --> 00:25:09,100
For repentance?

552
00:25:10,790 --> 00:25:11,920
Your friend, Hu Xiaofei,

553
00:25:11,920 --> 00:25:14,050
is a suspect in the 3/12 Case,

554
00:25:14,050 --> 00:25:16,330
and the person you hate is a victim in it.

555
00:25:16,720 --> 00:25:19,580
It's hard to convince us
that you weren't involved.

556
00:25:22,440 --> 00:25:23,640
I'll say it again—

557
00:25:24,090 --> 00:25:25,890
providing evidence is your job.

558
00:25:26,130 --> 00:25:26,780
Okay.

559
00:25:28,130 --> 00:25:29,980
Besides you,

560
00:25:30,010 --> 00:25:32,340
who else was Hu Xiaofei close to
back then?

561
00:25:32,830 --> 00:25:33,830
Bi Dehua, I guess.

562
00:25:33,930 --> 00:25:37,080
Didn't you claim that
you had no idea about their relationship?

563
00:25:37,080 --> 00:25:39,140
I know
they often played basketball together,

564
00:25:39,140 --> 00:25:40,200
but I wasn't really into basketball,

565
00:25:40,200 --> 00:25:41,550
so I rarely went to the court.

566
00:25:41,550 --> 00:25:42,980
Back when Bi Dehua was identified

567
00:25:42,980 --> 00:25:44,710
as the murderer in the 3/12 Case,

568
00:25:44,710 --> 00:25:46,090
how did you feel?

569
00:25:47,150 --> 00:25:48,190
I can't quite recall.

570
00:25:48,190 --> 00:25:51,320
Was there anything unusual
about Hu Xiaofei's reaction

571
00:25:51,790 --> 00:25:52,980
when he learned it?

572
00:25:53,370 --> 00:25:55,030
I don't remember that either.

573
00:25:56,750 --> 00:25:58,330
It was such a big deal,

574
00:25:59,260 --> 00:26:01,120
and you don't remember anything?

575
00:26:05,160 --> 00:26:06,520
Officers,

576
00:26:06,750 --> 00:26:07,950
it's been 7 or 8 years.

577
00:26:08,400 --> 00:26:09,940
Besides the samples
you went to great lengths

578
00:26:09,940 --> 00:26:11,330
to find back then,

579
00:26:11,350 --> 00:26:13,810
what else could've been preserved forever?

580
00:26:14,090 --> 00:26:14,960
Memories?

581
00:26:15,310 --> 00:26:17,710
They're the most unreliable, aren't they?

582
00:26:19,500 --> 00:26:20,070
Take it slow.

583
00:26:20,070 --> 00:26:21,470
-Be careful.
-It's okay.

584
00:26:22,090 --> 00:26:22,920
Be careful.

585
00:26:29,440 --> 00:26:31,900
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

586
00:26:37,810 --> 00:26:38,870
I'm sorry, Boss.

587
00:26:38,890 --> 00:26:41,090
I failed to keep the internet cafe safe.

588
00:26:42,620 --> 00:26:43,750
It's not your fault.

589
00:26:43,980 --> 00:26:46,310
I've been wanting to give everyone
a long vacation for the past few years,

590
00:26:46,310 --> 00:26:48,040
but I couldn't find the chance.

591
00:26:48,140 --> 00:26:49,530
Now we've got the chance, right?

592
00:26:49,530 --> 00:26:50,290
I hereby announce that

593
00:26:50,290 --> 00:26:52,140
Benteng Internet Cafe will be closed
for a month

594
00:26:52,140 --> 00:26:53,250
for a revamp.

595
00:26:53,440 --> 00:26:54,760
All employees will be on leave

596
00:26:54,760 --> 00:26:55,720
with full pay.

597
00:26:56,060 --> 00:26:57,490
Hooray, Boss!

598
00:26:57,900 --> 00:26:59,510
Boss, Kun resigned.

599
00:26:59,510 --> 00:27:02,000
He was probably poached by SN.

600
00:27:03,290 --> 00:27:04,530
Everyone has their own ambitions.

601
00:27:04,530 --> 00:27:05,420
Let him be.

602
00:27:08,090 --> 00:27:09,770
I'm relieved to see you

603
00:27:09,770 --> 00:27:10,940
in good spirits.

604
00:27:10,940 --> 00:27:12,250
Since the internet cafe is closed,

605
00:27:12,250 --> 00:27:13,510
I'll head back now.

606
00:27:13,560 --> 00:27:14,230
Hold on.

607
00:27:15,510 --> 00:27:16,440
Let's talk

608
00:27:16,460 --> 00:27:17,440
over a meal.

609
00:27:18,960 --> 00:27:20,670
Let's go. Take my car.

610
00:27:22,890 --> 00:27:23,880
Help me hold it.

611
00:27:23,880 --> 00:27:24,220
Okay.

612
00:27:25,200 --> 00:27:25,880
Yu!

613
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:26,920
Come help me hold it together.

614
00:27:26,920 --> 00:27:27,850
He's quite heavy.

615
00:27:27,850 --> 00:27:28,810
Hold it steady.

616
00:27:43,360 --> 00:27:45,260
Where are we going to eat?

617
00:27:45,290 --> 00:27:47,670
There's a private restaurant
not far up ahead.

618
00:27:47,670 --> 00:27:49,070
Few people know about it.

619
00:27:50,350 --> 00:27:52,130
Based on what Zhang Chengguo said,

620
00:27:52,130 --> 00:27:53,980
we found his friend, Wang Long.

621
00:27:54,070 --> 00:27:55,390
Wang Long is a contractor,

622
00:27:55,390 --> 00:27:56,600
and he confirmed that Zhang Chengguo

623
00:27:56,600 --> 00:27:58,480
indeed met Mr. San while playing cards

624
00:27:58,480 --> 00:27:59,940
at the construction site.

625
00:27:59,960 --> 00:28:01,530
We reorganized the timeline

626
00:28:01,530 --> 00:28:03,110
and found that after obtaining

627
00:28:03,110 --> 00:28:05,050
Song Laifu's identity, this Mr. San

628
00:28:05,050 --> 00:28:07,350
first worked at Wang Long's
construction site for 3 months.

629
00:28:07,350 --> 00:28:09,790
Then he utilized the negligence
of the household registration personnel

630
00:28:09,790 --> 00:28:11,550
to get a new second-generation ID card.

631
00:28:11,550 --> 00:28:13,510
Only after getting
a squeaky-clean identity

632
00:28:13,510 --> 00:28:17,570
was he arranged by Zhang Chengguo
to work as a security guard at the hotel.

633
00:28:18,160 --> 00:28:19,250
Zhang Chengguo can't be

634
00:28:19,250 --> 00:28:20,700
cleared of suspicion for now.

635
00:28:20,700 --> 00:28:21,830
Let's focus

636
00:28:21,830 --> 00:28:23,200
on Li Zhengbin for now.

637
00:28:23,750 --> 00:28:25,330
Li Zhengbin is rich and powerful.

638
00:28:25,330 --> 00:28:27,720
The probability of him participating
in the robbery and rape is lower, right?

639
00:28:27,720 --> 00:28:30,010
I didn't say
he was the direct perpetrator,

640
00:28:30,010 --> 00:28:31,640
but to some extent,

641
00:28:31,640 --> 00:28:33,240
he might have provided help.

642
00:28:33,380 --> 00:28:36,330
What if Zhang Chengguo is
Mr. San's accomplice?

643
00:28:36,350 --> 00:28:38,510
Like, Mr. San worked
at Wang Long's construction site

644
00:28:38,510 --> 00:28:40,550
just to normally meet Zhang Chengguo?

645
00:28:40,550 --> 00:28:42,110
That would require considering

646
00:28:42,110 --> 00:28:44,660
the issue of identity exposure
from a long time ago.

647
00:28:44,660 --> 00:28:45,960
But once the crimes
Mr. San committed were exposed...

648
00:28:45,110 --> 00:28:47,630
[Sender: Elite Student]

649
00:28:45,960 --> 00:28:47,400
A friend is treating me to dinner.

650
00:28:47,400 --> 00:28:48,160
I won't be home for dinner.

651
00:28:48,160 --> 00:28:50,240
Is it necessary to go to such lengths
for an accomplice?

652
00:28:50,240 --> 00:28:51,620
I'm going out for a bit.

653
00:28:52,030 --> 00:28:53,460
Where are you going? We're in a meeting.

654
00:28:53,460 --> 00:28:54,290
There's an emergency at home.

655
00:28:54,290 --> 00:28:56,890
I'll check the meeting minutes
when I get back.

656
00:29:04,800 --> 00:29:05,720
What's up?

657
00:29:07,380 --> 00:29:08,580
It was my mom calling.

658
00:29:08,700 --> 00:29:10,310
She was probably waiting for me
to have dinner at home.

659
00:29:10,310 --> 00:29:11,800
I suddenly told her
I wasn't going back for dinner,

660
00:29:11,800 --> 00:29:12,710
so she called to ask.

661
00:29:12,710 --> 00:29:13,500
Just ignore her.

662
00:29:13,500 --> 00:29:14,650
Then ask her to come along.

663
00:29:14,650 --> 00:29:15,920
I haven't met your mom yet.

664
00:29:15,920 --> 00:29:17,400
Why ask her to come?

665
00:29:17,420 --> 00:29:19,110
Didn't you want to chat with me?

666
00:29:19,110 --> 00:29:21,110
It would be awkward with her around.

667
00:29:24,300 --> 00:29:25,130
What are you doing?

668
00:29:25,060 --> 00:29:26,120
[Old Foodie] [A friend is treating me
to dinner. I won't be home for dinner.]

669
00:29:25,160 --> 00:29:26,220
Focus on driving!

670
00:29:26,220 --> 00:29:28,750
You saved your mom's contact
as "Old Foodie"?

671
00:29:30,380 --> 00:29:31,570
My mom has a huge appetite.

672
00:29:31,570 --> 00:29:33,900
She can eat 3 bowls of rice
in a single meal.

673
00:29:34,770 --> 00:29:36,400
I'm sending her the address.

674
00:29:36,420 --> 00:29:37,770
You can add a few words.

675
00:29:37,980 --> 00:29:39,030
She can come if she wants to,

676
00:29:39,030 --> 00:29:40,630
and it's fine if she doesn't.

677
00:29:41,400 --> 00:29:42,510
I just need to show

678
00:29:42,510 --> 00:29:43,970
my manners as your friend.

679
00:29:48,330 --> 00:29:48,800
[Old Foodie] [No. 8, Wolong Yinquan Villa]

680
00:29:48,830 --> 00:29:49,740
[Inbox] [Old Foodie]

681
00:29:53,830 --> 00:29:56,000
No. 8, Wolong Yinquan Villa.

682
00:29:53,980 --> 00:29:57,510
[Sender: Elite Student]

683
00:29:56,190 --> 00:29:59,140
Mom, my friend just sent
the restaurant address.

684
00:29:59,200 --> 00:30:00,780
He said he wanted to invite you
to join us for dinner.

685
00:30:00,780 --> 00:30:01,820
He's just being polite.

686
00:30:01,820 --> 00:30:03,220
Don't take it seriously.

687
00:30:05,400 --> 00:30:06,880
[Public Security]

688
00:30:14,130 --> 00:30:14,830
No. 8.

689
00:30:44,600 --> 00:30:46,210
Is this a place to eat?

690
00:30:53,070 --> 00:30:54,090
Mr. Han!

691
00:30:54,350 --> 00:30:56,150
You haven't come for a long time.

692
00:30:56,550 --> 00:30:57,850
Are there any private rooms upstairs?

693
00:30:57,850 --> 00:30:59,150
Yes, this way, please.

694
00:31:02,270 --> 00:31:03,530
Please mind the steps.

695
00:31:05,780 --> 00:31:07,080
How many of you today?

696
00:31:07,110 --> 00:31:07,790
Two.

697
00:31:07,930 --> 00:31:08,540
Okay.

698
00:31:11,100 --> 00:31:12,040
Be careful.

699
00:31:13,790 --> 00:31:14,790
This way, please.

700
00:31:24,810 --> 00:31:27,180
This place looks unusually posh.

701
00:31:27,240 --> 00:31:29,700
Han, you're really broadening my horizons.

702
00:31:30,600 --> 00:31:32,060
I rarely come here either.

703
00:31:32,660 --> 00:31:33,990
You're being too modest.

704
00:31:33,990 --> 00:31:35,920
The waiters here all know you.

705
00:31:36,580 --> 00:31:38,780
I'm just a nobody.

706
00:31:38,810 --> 00:31:40,330
I'm actually feeling out of place

707
00:31:40,330 --> 00:31:42,260
staying somewhere this high-end.

708
00:31:43,490 --> 00:31:45,150
What do you want to talk about?

709
00:31:45,750 --> 00:31:47,750
I just need someone to open up to.

710
00:31:48,010 --> 00:31:50,070
I'll just say whatever comes to mind.

711
00:31:51,210 --> 00:31:53,310
Then why don't you
talk to Wei and the others?

712
00:31:53,310 --> 00:31:54,640
They are not like you.

713
00:31:55,010 --> 00:31:56,990
There are a lot of things
they can't understand,

714
00:31:56,990 --> 00:31:58,140
but you can.

715
00:31:59,770 --> 00:32:01,300
Am I that special?

716
00:32:03,020 --> 00:32:04,810
This restaurant doesn't have a menu.

717
00:32:04,810 --> 00:32:06,950
No matter how many guests are
in a private room,

718
00:32:06,950 --> 00:32:08,420
the dishes served are the same.

719
00:32:08,420 --> 00:32:09,810
I just forgot to ask

720
00:32:09,890 --> 00:32:11,560
about the main course today.

721
00:32:12,730 --> 00:32:14,380
This sounds even more luxurious.

722
00:32:14,380 --> 00:32:16,350
It's definitely not a place I can afford.

723
00:32:16,350 --> 00:32:18,790
I only knew
there was such a place in Huangshui

724
00:32:18,790 --> 00:32:21,450
because I came here with my dad
when I was little.

725
00:32:23,950 --> 00:32:26,870
What does your dad do?

726
00:32:27,240 --> 00:32:28,110
He was a driver.

727
00:32:28,290 --> 00:32:29,140
A driver?

728
00:32:29,940 --> 00:32:31,880
My dad and the boss here

729
00:32:31,900 --> 00:32:33,190
used to be colleagues.

730
00:32:34,080 --> 00:32:35,340
My dad was the driver,

731
00:32:35,790 --> 00:32:37,590
and the boss here was
the executive assistant.

732
00:32:37,590 --> 00:32:39,270
Later, the company went bankrupt.

733
00:32:39,270 --> 00:32:41,000
The executive assistant
started his own business.

734
00:32:41,000 --> 00:32:42,900
He opened restaurants and hotels

735
00:32:42,900 --> 00:32:44,020
and got into real estate

736
00:32:44,020 --> 00:32:45,770
as his business kept expanding,

737
00:32:45,770 --> 00:32:47,070
while my dad

738
00:32:47,070 --> 00:32:48,870
could only live off his savings.

739
00:32:49,070 --> 00:32:51,830
He got seriously ill
and died a couple of years later.

740
00:32:51,830 --> 00:32:53,200
Luckily, I pushed him to open

741
00:32:53,200 --> 00:32:55,000
an internet cafe for me early on.

742
00:32:55,030 --> 00:32:56,050
You have no idea.

743
00:32:56,240 --> 00:32:58,460
Business licenses were
very hard to get back then.

744
00:32:58,460 --> 00:32:59,240
Without his connections,

745
00:32:59,240 --> 00:33:00,770
I couldn't have gotten one.

746
00:33:01,570 --> 00:33:04,590
There aren't many successful big shots
in Huangshui.

747
00:33:05,030 --> 00:33:07,250
In view of this assistant-turned-boss's
business empire,

748
00:33:07,250 --> 00:33:09,000
could it be the boss of Huangzhiyuan,

749
00:33:09,000 --> 00:33:10,220
Li Zhengbin?

750
00:33:10,500 --> 00:33:11,090
Yes,

751
00:33:11,460 --> 00:33:13,320
he is the boss of this restaurant.

752
00:33:13,500 --> 00:33:14,550
You know him?

753
00:33:14,960 --> 00:33:15,790
He's a famous boss.

754
00:33:15,790 --> 00:33:17,510
I've heard of him more or less.

755
00:33:17,960 --> 00:33:19,940
Your dad and Li Zhengbin were colleagues?

756
00:33:19,940 --> 00:33:21,330
That's awesome!

757
00:33:23,740 --> 00:33:25,380
Li Zhengbin is the awesome one.

758
00:33:25,380 --> 00:33:28,220
The veterans of our county's
early infrastructure projects

759
00:33:28,220 --> 00:33:29,950
came from all over the country.

760
00:33:30,740 --> 00:33:32,110
When people get old,

761
00:33:32,110 --> 00:33:34,310
they miss the taste of their hometowns.

762
00:33:34,810 --> 00:33:35,610
So Li Zhengbin

763
00:33:35,610 --> 00:33:37,420
hired chefs from these leaders' hometowns

764
00:33:37,420 --> 00:33:40,030
and shipped ingredients

765
00:33:40,090 --> 00:33:41,910
to serve them specifically.

766
00:33:42,250 --> 00:33:43,510
Later, he built

767
00:33:43,530 --> 00:33:47,330
even stronger connections
than when he was an executive assistant.

768
00:33:48,100 --> 00:33:49,560
Did you notice it just now?

769
00:33:49,590 --> 00:33:51,650
This restaurant doesn't have a sign.

770
00:33:52,140 --> 00:33:53,660
But it's always had a name—

771
00:33:53,720 --> 00:33:54,800
Homesickness.

772
00:33:55,290 --> 00:33:57,020
An old leader gave it this name,

773
00:33:57,220 --> 00:33:59,240
meaning the enduring homesickness

774
00:33:59,240 --> 00:34:00,940
and longing to return to one's roots.

775
00:34:00,940 --> 00:34:02,260
Everything here

776
00:34:02,350 --> 00:34:04,380
was carefully selected by Li Zhengbin,

777
00:34:04,380 --> 00:34:05,910
including the waitresses.

778
00:34:06,790 --> 00:34:08,460
What kind of feelings

779
00:34:09,780 --> 00:34:11,580
is this "Homesickness" anyway?

780
00:34:14,739 --> 00:34:15,920
Funny, huh?

781
00:34:17,590 --> 00:34:20,190
My stepmother was a waitress here
back then...

782
00:34:21,610 --> 00:34:22,409
Du Juan.

783
00:34:25,110 --> 00:34:25,960
Just a few years

784
00:34:25,960 --> 00:34:28,090
after this woman hooked up with my dad,

785
00:34:28,510 --> 00:34:29,960
on April 28, 2001,

786
00:34:29,960 --> 00:34:31,880
my mom died in a car accident,

787
00:34:32,520 --> 00:34:34,650
leaving those two free to be together.

788
00:34:37,630 --> 00:34:40,800
What a coincidence it was.

789
00:34:41,860 --> 00:34:44,159
How perfect it was for them.

790
00:34:47,980 --> 00:34:49,090
So,

791
00:34:49,690 --> 00:34:51,380
you suspect that Du Juan

792
00:34:51,650 --> 00:34:53,420
got your mom killed?

793
00:34:57,730 --> 00:34:59,510
What I think is not important.

794
00:35:00,240 --> 00:35:02,060
The traffic police said
it was an accident,

795
00:35:02,060 --> 00:35:03,970
so it can only be an accident.

796
00:35:07,780 --> 00:35:09,400
Sir, everything is ready.

797
00:35:09,400 --> 00:35:10,860
Shall we serve the dishes?

798
00:35:11,520 --> 00:35:12,210
Serve them.

799
00:35:14,150 --> 00:35:16,170
Aren't we supposed
to go to the East Market?

800
00:35:16,170 --> 00:35:17,300
I think you might want to come here

801
00:35:17,300 --> 00:35:18,630
rather than go home.

802
00:35:18,840 --> 00:35:20,900
Hu Xiaofei was my best friend.

803
00:35:21,000 --> 00:35:23,830
I really wish Xiaofei were alive,

804
00:35:23,850 --> 00:35:25,780
but maybe death was

805
00:35:25,880 --> 00:35:27,670
a sort of relief for him.
